Reference sources for the bare-metal drivers
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The bare-metal target (crates/nanochrono-baremetal) talks to hardware that
has no portable interface: the 8042 keyboard controller, the Synopsys
DesignWare I2C master Intel ships in its LPSS block, I2C-HID touchpads and
keyboards, and xHCI. Two existing driver trees were consulted while writing
those, and they are not consulted on the same terms.

